		{"id":"node-1","type":"text","text":"# Welcome to Obsidian Canvas\n\nThis text node supports **bold**, *italic*, and `code`.\n\n- List item one\n- List item two\n\n> A blockquote for emphasis","x":-95,"y":-90,"width":320,"height":270,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-5","type":"text","text":"## Markdown Features\n\nVisit [Rspress](https://rspress.dev) for docs. Tag: #canvas #rspress/demo\n\n> [!tip] Did you know?\n> Canvas renders callouts, math, and diagrams.\n\nInline math: $E = mc^2$. A note[^1].\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[Start] --> B[End]\n```\n\n[^1]: A footnote body.","x":1060,"y":110,"width":440,"height":460,"color":"1"},
